Subject: [PATCH] WIP r51: host-split order mechanism + plan-order trace;
 token_embd proven absent from the Vulkan plan

Conflict-resolved: S4 split (f172be756): auto_split - our hunks re-homed into ggml-vulkan-buffers.cpp; wrap/same-point regions merged in place (fixS4_629.py)
